c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-23b4d400d5378df10709","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-4ce0c1dddf345dda79e4","layer":"original","quote":"倭女王卑弥呼与狗奴国男王卑弥弓呼，素不和，遣倭载斯、乌越等诣郡，说相攻击状","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":458,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-4fc5b65e8c33916864f0","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-f848018d834dbd8017f8","layer":"original","quote":"其年十二月，诏书报倭女王曰：“制诏亲魏倭王卑弥呼〖1〗：带方太守刘夏，遣使送汝大夫难升米、次使都市牛利，奉汝所献男生口四人〖2〗，女生口六人，班布二匹二丈，已到。汝所在逾远，乃遣使贡献；是汝之忠孝〖3〗，我甚哀汝〖4〗。今以汝为亲魏倭王，假金印、紫绶〖5〗，装封付带方太守，假授汝。其绥抚种人〖6〗，勉为孝顺。汝来使难升米、牛利，涉远，道路勤劳；今以难升米为率善中郎将〖7〗，牛利为率善校尉；假银印、青绶，引见劳赐遣还〖8〗。今以绛地交龙锦五匹、﹝一﹞绛地绉粟罽十张、茜绛五十匹、绀青五十匹〖9〗，答汝所献贡直〖10〗。又特赐汝绀地句文锦三匹、细班华罽五张、白绢五十匹、金八两、五尺刀二口、铜镜百枚，真珠、铅丹各五十斤〖11〗；皆装封付难升米、牛利，还到录受〖12〗。悉可以示汝国中人，使知国家哀汝，故郑重赐汝好物也〖13〗。”","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":439,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":364,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-5c1b92149751cba26a06","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-e89c6ba73f0a7fa210da","layer":"original","quote":"景初（二）〔三〕年六月，倭女王遣大夫难升米等诣郡，求诣天子朝献","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":438,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-98027bb6997e7105cc92","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-5436fe5eed8b2d88f066","layer":"original","quote":"乃共立一女子为王，名曰“卑弥呼”","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":432,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":29,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-c9ea86ac12adaf59d5e9","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-4ce0c1dddf345dda79e4","layer":"original","quote":"卑弥呼已死，大作冢，径百余步，殉葬者奴婢百余人","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":458,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":84,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-d32d5b918045beae42d6","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-53fc0d9cb95268365be9","layer":"original","quote":"倭王因使上表答谢恩诏","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":456,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":57,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-d9316bef06a87ca53587","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-74432852c15f7cac2c55","layer":"original","quote":"其四年〖3〗，倭王复遣使大夫伊声耆掖邪狗等八人，上献生口、倭锦、绛青缣、绵衣、帛布、丹木、、短弓矢","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":457,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-e1f7225b6cdbb7915356","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-5436fe5eed8b2d88f066","layer":"original","quote":"其国本亦以男子为王。住七八十年〖1〗，倭国乱，相攻伐历年；乃共立一女子为王，名曰“卑弥呼”；事鬼道，能惑众。年已长大，无夫婿，有男弟佐治国。自为王以来，少有见者。以婢千人自侍；唯有男子一人给饮食，传辞出入。居处宫室楼观，城栅严设，常有人持兵守卫。","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":432,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-f4267ad236627b5c9d26","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-53fc0d9cb95268365be9","layer":"original","quote":"拜假倭王，并赍诏赐金、帛、锦罽、刀、镜、采物","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":456,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":31,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
